	"data": "Core System — Technical Outline\n\nA detailed functional specification for the Core Runtime. This is the what it does document — the production plan covers when and in what order; this covers how it works.\nPurpose & Principles\n\nThe Core Runtime is a module host. It is not an app, not a framework, not a game engine. It does exactly three things:\nDiscover and load modules at runtime\nConnect modules through a shared event bus and data substrate\nManage module lifecycle — activate, deactivate,…",
